hild-rearing at home.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d01:c0", "entity": "Women's Strike", "scope": "Iceland", "claim": "The Women's Strike in Iceland took place on 24 October 1975.", "answer": "24 October 1975", "quote": "But Vigdis insists she would never have been president had it not been for the events of one sunny day - 24 October 1975 - when 90 % of women in the country decided to demonstrate their importance by going on strike .", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d02:c0", "entity": "Women's Strike", "scope": "Icelandic women's strike", "claim": "The Icelandic women's strike took place on 24 October 1975.", "answer": "24 October 1975", "quote": "1975 Icelandic women 's strike Women 's Day Off Date 24 October 1975 Location Iceland Caused by Gender pay gap , occupational sexism Goals To `` demonstrate the indispensable work of women for Iceland 's economy and society '' and `` protest wage discrepancy and unfair employment practices '' . Methods Women 's strike On 24 October 1975 , Icelandic women went on strike for the day to `` demonstrate the indispensable work of women for Iceland 's economy and society '' [ 1 ] and to `` protest wage discrepancy and unfair employment practices '' .", "original_document_number": 3}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0404-ff7df3fcbbb9:d03:c0", "entity": "Women's Strike", "scope": "Spanish women's strike", "claim": "On March 8, 2018, International Women's Day, Spanish women went on strike for the day to denounce sexual discrimination, domestic violence and the wage gap.", "answer": "March 8, 2018", "quote": "2018 Spanish women's strike On March 8, 2018, International Women's Day, Spanish women went on strike for the day to denounce sexual discrimination, domestic violence and the wage gap .", "original_document_number": 4}, {"doc_id":